{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"北角男途人遭巴士撞斃\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-09-10-26-231SjaYI1r.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】北角有途人過馬路時遭巴士撞倒，送院不治。</p><p>涉事城巴停在路中，車頭擋風玻璃凹陷。警方早上8時許接報，一輛城巴沿英皇道東行，駛到近電廠街交界撞倒一名過馬路的男子，傷者頭部重創昏迷，由救護車送東區醫院，經搶救後證實不治。警方正調查意外原因。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.457601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T02:05:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.153573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.333748+00:00","content_hash":"d72674a3a2b296e816ee51549e4af76cdf7d8f3437dfb5e16ea8e8d92c38d68f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.457601+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}